# Vendoring boundary for this fixture's determinism requirement (#2190) —
# see ../../references/languages/javascript.md "Test determinism & the
# vendoring boundary" and ./README.md for the full rationale.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore excludes `node_modules/` everywhere; a nested
# .gitignore cannot re-include files under an already-excluded *directory*
# (only an excluded *file*) unless it first un-excludes the directory itself
# — hence the `!node_modules/` line below before re-narrowing.
#
# fast-check (+ its own only dependency, pure-rand) is vendored: both are
# pure JS, no native/platform-specific binaries, ~1.8M total — identical on
# every dev machine and CI runner.
!node_modules/
node_modules/*
!node_modules/fast-check/
!node_modules/pure-rand/

# vitest and its transitive deps are intentionally NOT vendored (platform-
# native binaries — see README.md) and stay excluded by the root
# `node_modules/` rule via the `node_modules/*` re-narrowing above.
